    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "The funnel over the range, by sport",
      "description": "Each step summed over the range, by sport, both streams together. A sport with uploads but nothing matched has channels about nobody followed; one with nothing at all has no channel (the admin's Feed tab lists each channel's yield).",
